## elaborations.soar -- thor-soar: 1 elaboration, 1 compare.

## Elaborate Impasse Operator Tie state force-learn.
sp {Impasse__Operator_Tie*elaborate*state*force-learn
    :default
   (state <s> ^name selection)
-->
   (force-learn <s>)
}

## Preference for selection prefer-lower-evaluation equal-numeric-value use-expected-distance.
## If equal from numeric-value then rely on expected distance to make a preference. Not sure if this will work.
## Depends on expected-value - use probabilities to avoid conflicts
sp {selection*compare*prefer-lower-evaluation*equal-numeric-value*use-expected-distance
   :default
   (state <s> ^name selection
              ^superstate <superstate>
              ^evaluation <evaluation1>
                          { <> <evaluation1> <evaluation2> })
   (<superstate> ^desireds <desireds>)
   (<evaluation1> ^super-operator { <> <operator2> <operator1> }
                  ^numeric-value  { <v> <> no-value }
                  ^desireds.duplicate-of <desireds>)
   (<operator1> ^expected-distance <expected-distance1>)
   (<evaluation2> ^super-operator { <> <operator1> <operator2> }
                  ^numeric-value { <v> <> no-value }
                  ^desireds.duplicate-of <desireds>)
   (<operator2> ^expected-distance > <expected-distance1>)
-->
   (<superstate> ^operator <operator2> = .1
                 ^operator <operator1> = .9)}
